1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:01,100
You're a horned lizard,

2
00:00:01,120 --> 00:00:01,663
and a coyote

3
00:00:01,683 --> 00:00:02,657
just grabbed you.

4
00:00:02,677 --> 00:00:04,198
Your camouflage didn't work.

5
00:00:04,218 --> 00:00:04,960
Puffing up didn't

6
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:05,735
work either.

7
00:00:05,755 --> 00:00:06,560
So you squeeze the

8
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:07,765
veins in your head.

9
00:00:07,785 --> 00:00:08,915
Pressure builds behind

10
00:00:08,935 --> 00:00:09,465
your eyes,

11
00:00:09,485 --> 00:00:10,328
and you shoot blood

12
00:00:10,348 --> 00:00:11,128
out of them.

13
00:00:11,148 --> 00:00:11,928
It can fly more

14
00:00:11,948 --> 00:00:12,773
than a meter.

15
00:00:12,793 --> 00:00:13,486
And to dogs

16
00:00:13,506 --> 00:00:14,086
and coyotes,

17
00:00:14,106 --> 00:00:15,233
it tastes awful.

18
00:00:15,253 --> 00:00:16,020
They drop you,

19
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:16,858
shake their heads

20
00:00:16,878 --> 00:00:17,711
and drool.

21
00:00:17,731 --> 00:00:18,786
Birds don't care,

22
00:00:18,806 --> 00:00:19,398
so you save

23
00:00:19,418 --> 00:00:20,298
it for dogs.

24
00:00:20,318 --> 00:00:21,281
Worth it.
